    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ye there! Aye, I'm talkin' ta ye! We've made the discovery of a lifetime down in Un'Goro! Can ye believe it?\r\n\r\nThere's just one problem... our dig site's been overrun by voracious beasts of the killin' nature. Very unpleasant indeed.\r\n\r\nWith yer help, we can reclaim our camp and git back ta workin'. Now, what do ye say? I'll make it worth yer while.",
